OL,3,GNEWSAKey to Paul McCartney's childhood
OL,4,Ahome up for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "remarkable piece of Beatles history"
OL,7,Fwill go under the hammer next month at
OL,8,Fa Gloucestershire auction house.
OL,10,FSir Paul McCartney lived with his
OL,11,Ffamily at 20 Forthlin Road, Allerton,
OL,12,FLiverpool, for eight years until 1963,
OL,13,Fwhere he composed some of The Beatles'
OL,14,Fearliest songs with bandmate John
OL,15,FLennon.
OL,17,FAfter McCartney and, later, his brother
OL,18,Fand father moved out, a front door key
OL,19,Fand a photograph of the house was
OL,20,Fenclosed in a letter to American fan
OL,21,FKathy Salt from then-occupant Ashley
OL,22,FJones, in 1965.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
